[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799856511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105335#issuecomment-2799856511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105335","id":2799856511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m4mt_","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T08:22:52Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T08:22:52Z","body":"The Godot engine and the libraries it depends on all have a size, and are included when you exported your project so that it can run, which means there is always some base size for an exported project. Even if you write 1 line of code, the engine still needs to be exported to run it, so you'll still get something around this size. You'll see this as well with engines like Unity, though Unity's base size is larger. This is just part of the trade off you are making when you choose to use an engine over writing the equivalent systems yourself.\n\nIf you are very concerned about output size, you can do things like manually build the engine without certain modules, so they also won't be included in the exports, but this is only really something worth doing for proper release builds near the end of your project if you have a size constraint. See https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/compiling/optimizing_for_size.html","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799856511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799909574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105335#issuecomment-2799909574","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105335","id":2799909574,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m4zrG","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T11:12:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T11:12:14Z","body":"This is f